FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H004CD27B,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Pink,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00A67DFı,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Yellow,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H003493DA,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: NolandBookLiar,Impress BT,37,&H00E3B38E,&H000000FF,&H004D555C,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: NolandBookNoland,Impress BT,37,&H0037258E,&H000000FF,&H004D555C,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,2,120,120,18,1Style: DevilFruitsBook,Impress BT,55,&H001FıD24,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,1.5,2,120,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:51.41,Title,,0,0,230,,The Iron MaskDialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice work out there, Ichiji, Niji.Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:06.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The war-torn Broc Coli is another victim of the fall of the Doflamingo regime, you could say.Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:14.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Their army could no longer acquire weapons from Doflamingo, so they turned to us for help.Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:19.45,Main,,0,0,0,,They gave up on the idea of merely suppressing their rivals...Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a good example of how halfhearted kindness only leads to more bloodshed in the end.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares about the reason why?Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We just make whoever pays us gets to win, and that's it.Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,If we had crushed both sides, we could've earned even more money.Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what pirates would do.Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:42.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We're still a member nation of the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Father, the Reverie will take place soon.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,However, they'll likely strip us of our right to attend the Reverie starting from this one.Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you, be prepared for it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:01.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The power that we'll get in exchange is tremendous!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa will change!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's rare for anything to bring so much pleasure to Father.Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you came in handy, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We were surprised on the day that you disappeared.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Truly.Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:30.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We used to talk about you from time to time.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,We wondered where the funniest place for you to die would be, and how it might happen.Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You still have food on your plate, Niji. Eat all of it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This? I'll just leave it. I'm not hungry.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:04:01.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I ate tons of chocolate earlier, and this sauce that's poured on it looks nasty.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:03.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all sticky and gross.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing this away.Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know how valuable food is or how much work goes into cooking, you dumb prince!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:15.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Dumb?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a weakling, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:22.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no right to insult me and tell me what to do!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:26.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Call the head chef! Where are you, Cosette?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:31.02,Captions,,30,0,240,,Head Chef CosetteDialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you served this disgusting stuff, my brother has offended me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:39.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't serve anything unpalatable to you...Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay right there, Cosette.Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard... How low will you sink?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to leave a scar on a lady's face?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say? A lady?Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:07.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you defending a mere kitchen maid?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What a gentleman.Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Now the food's on the floor.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:24.10,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Aligot. It's a mixture of potatoes and cheese.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama, I'll clean it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:33.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Potatoes strengthen the immune system and stabilize blood pressure.Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:36.69,Main,,0,0,0,,They're very nutritious.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And maybe because you guys are so special,Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,the cut of meat in the confit has been carefully selected too.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a very elaborate dish to make for breakfast.Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't, Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,A person of royal blood mustn't eat food off the floor!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you out of your mind?! That's disgusting!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly flavored, too.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The spirit of the poor has taken root in you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop doing such a disgraceful thing!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:14.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't, Niji! He hasn't been married yet!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:32.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You only bring shame to the Vinsmokes.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What's shameful to me is being part of this family!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:38.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,An idiot who has no respect for food. A man who beats a woman!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The arrogance of royalty that compels you to see your servants as less than human!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:54.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything about you guys goes against what I stand for!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:59.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What you're saying is the kind of nonsense all those losers spout, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:04.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never understood the way you see things.Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Royalty operates by its own set of rules!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the unreasonable one!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:18.80,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right. You're more wrong than ever.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it because of the bad influence from this man, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:38.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's ability to collect information is greater than people think.Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:42.89,Main,,0,0,0,,So you were working at his restaurant until two years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:45.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already zeroed in on its location, too.Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:49.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like this picture was taken recently.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea restaurant, Baratie!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're turning pale.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:05.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did your spirit from earlier go, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Say something. Huh? Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What are those?Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,These are bracelets to prevent him from escaping-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:31.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like both the Straw Hats and Sanji himself areDialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,going to oppose this marriage-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll lend you these bracelets and tell you his weak point just in case-soir.Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,His weak point?Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, only in the worst-case scenario where you refuse to comply,Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Will I stoop to asking you if you want us to chop his head off.Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid. You know what we're capable of.Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ever resist.Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Give up on your friends and accept your marriage to Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, everything will wrap up neatly.Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:39.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to your leg?Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:46.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any reason for you to be kind to me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:49.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Why...? Why did you?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:57.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you... have the same dream as me.Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The All Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awesome, you damn geezer! Is this the sea restaurant?Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.28,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be busy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine 'cause I'm here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:25.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too slow, baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not, you damn geezer!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Fooling around with a woman again, baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:34.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:39.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:52.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Owner Zeff!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:13.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the damn things you've done for me over all these years!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness... for the rest of my life!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a peaceful wedding tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:40.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have lunch with Big Mom and Pudding today.Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to leave for her castle.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:53.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn Straw Hat... Where did he go?Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Search for him.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:13:01.52,Main,,0,0,0,,10 minutes is long...Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't even use Haki.Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Is somebody there?Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, help! Call a doctor!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! They waited until I wasn't around!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What did she do to deserve this?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They beat a woman unconscious...Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:50.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never met such scum!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yonji!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:59.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You gave a woman of low birth a taste of self-confidence.Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, you bastard?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see Niji? Obviously, he's the one who did it.Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow me. I'll take you to him.Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be fine. Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you coming?Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:35.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm more than happy to!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You were curious, weren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:51.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We were never allowed in here as kids.Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,54 Type-MBs. 30 Type-MSTs.Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,And 21 Type-MHs need to be restocked.Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know what they are?Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa 66 is feared around the world.Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,And these are its soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama!!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:40.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker?! Is that him?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:52.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, King Baum?Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking Straw Hat's side?Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a good reason for it...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No excuse.Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:18.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you all!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with him?Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Woman, I'm Sweet Commander Cracker.Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch...Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.71,Main,,0,0,0,,...my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The soldiers of Germa 66?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they in water?Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a bio-culture liquid.Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:12.77,Main,,0,0,0,,They all have the same face... Are they actually alive?Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:15.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji, human beings...Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:17.64,Main,,0,0,0,,...can be built!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa has been a kingdom of science for generations.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:26.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, our father is a brilliant scientist.Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:29.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we were born,Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,he was part of a lawless research team in a foreign territoryDialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:38.35,Main,,0,0,0,,where he was studying and developing weapons with the great Dr. Vegapunk.Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:40.33,Main,,0,0,0,,He was with Vegapunk?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:42.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, when he was younger.Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What Vegapunk discovered at that time wasDialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,the presence of Bloodline Elements within living things!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:54.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It was just one step away from usurping God's place.Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,In essence, he found the blueprints of life.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The World Government saw it as dangerous and arrested Vegapunk.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:10.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The research team was disbanded. Or rather, it was absorbed by the Government.Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,However, our father escaped the Government's reachDialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,and continued his research here in Germa.Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The research into replicating and augmenting life itself.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Thus leading to the birth of this secret facility!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all clones of just a few talented soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:36.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They're Clone Soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.39,0:19:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Clone?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:49.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, none of them are aware of that.Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You see, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Many countries are afraid of our army, but at the same time, they wish to have it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It only makes sense, they are mighty, subservient...Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.15,0:20:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,They're programmed not to fear death and not to turn on their masters.Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,When they die, we can just replace them.Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It takes five years to create a twenty-year old soldier.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the depot where we keep a stock of the soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Look. It only takes five years to create them,Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but they look like they've been around for two decades.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:33.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! That's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be sick.Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,When we heard that you became a pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:02.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe our little failure was actually growing up a bit.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Then it turned out you were as big a disappointment as ever.Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:08.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Niji!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You sick bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:23.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:27.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You kitchen maid.Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:34.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Um...Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What did Cosette-chan do...Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,...to deserve that?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What you did was a high crime! I'll teach you a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sanji! Don't forget that we're holding a hostage in the East Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:03.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Stealth.Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it... Have you taken a liking to that kitchen maid?Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fight back. Otherwise, there will be blood in the East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Henry...Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,...Needle!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:48.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You should've told me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.91,0:22:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If I knew you were in love with that kitchen maid,Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have messed up her face.Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:23:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But if you have no problem with that swollen face,Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll appoint her to be your servant right away.Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Once again, welcome back, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,To the Vinsmoke Family!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it's high time we re-establish the hierarchy here.Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.45,0:23:29.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You are... a failure.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen! You children are my greatest scientific achievements!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:48.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You were born as superhumans through scientific modificationsDialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,representing the best that research has to offer!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:56.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Without living under the sway of foolish emotions,Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.45,0:23:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,each of you will eventually lead your own troopsDialogue: 0,0:23:59.90,0:24:07.53,Main,,0,0,0,,and one day rule Germa 66 with the ever-evolving power of science!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I have given you the ability. The rest comes down to discipline!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.35,0:24:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.25,0:25:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.31,0:25:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.05,0:25:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.43,0:26:01.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.18,0:26:02.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Come here.Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.65,0:26:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop playing with a turtle!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.01,0:26:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.74,0:26:15.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me like that!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Humph! That'll teach ya!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:23.36,Main,,0,0,0,,--Sanji-sama! --Niji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.52,0:26:41.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.11,0:26:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I give up! Niji!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.65,0:26:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please stop!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Niji-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.58,0:27:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go! I still wanna hit him!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.54,0:27:08.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is Sanji weaker than the others? He's lagging far behind the others' scores.Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We have the test results.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.14,0:27:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Ichiji-sama, Niji-sama and Yonji-sama are making excellent progress.Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Their exoskeletons are developing wellDialogue: 0,0:27:22.69,0:27:28.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and their resilience and strength are equivalent to full-grown men.Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.10,0:27:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,However, Sanji-sama is... It pains me to say...Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it? Say it.Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He must be considered a failure.Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.63,0:27:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought we successfully manipulated the Bloodline Elements for all four of them.Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.05,0:27:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, Sanji's Bloodline Elements are no different from when he was born.Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:27:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,So you mean...Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.43,0:28:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama is nothing but a human.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you help me?Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.99,0:28:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't want me to?Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I do!Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.41,0:28:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Reiju, you're so kind.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.79,0:28:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:29.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kind, but why do you laugh at me?Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.13,0:28:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What else can I do?! If I try to stop them, they'll bully me, too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want that!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.43,0:28:42.83,NolandBookLiar,,0,0,0,,The LiarDialogue: 0,0:28:38.43,0:28:42.83,NolandBookNoland,,0,0,0,,NolandDialogue: 0,0:28:38.43,0:28:42.83,DevilFruitsBook,,0,0,0,,The Devil FruitsDialogue: 0,0:28:41.60,0:28:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.73,0:28:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You can eat that.Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.27,0:28:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I made it for you.Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.90,0:28:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it good?Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:59.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Are you cooking food for rats again?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.29,0:29:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Royalty does not serve! How many times do I have to tell you?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.87,0:29:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,But, I...Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:09.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mother is dead! Stop chasing her shadow!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.80,0:29:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Unlike your siblings, you have no talent!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.70,0:29:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you must work 10 times harder... No, 100 times harder than the others!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.10,0:29:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You are a piece of my plan to restore Germa to glory!Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.71,0:29:26.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not let me down!Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.45,0:29:36.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Never cook again!Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.59,0:29:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that how you run, Sanji?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.19,0:29:59.60,Main,,0,0,0,,No progress.Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,--So he has no potential. --Right.Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.14,0:30:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste of life.Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.42,0:30:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.69,0:30:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,An unthinkable shipwreck... I mourn!Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:19.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I was expecting all five of them to lead Germa into the future together!Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.53,0:30:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I have lost a promising son!Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.25,0:30:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.05,0:30:37.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this? I can't take it off! What are you guys doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Sanji really die?Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.14,0:30:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Who really cares about him anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! I don't wanna be in here!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.03,0:30:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me out!Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me behind! I'm scared! I'm gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I want my dad!Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Dad! Help! They're gonna kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This was His Majesty's decision.Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Dad's decision?Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.38,0:31:15.15,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! There must be a mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.51,0:31:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,His Majesty said that he wants to pretend that you were never born.Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.99,0:31:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.11,0:31:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why...?Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let me out, Dad...Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.66,0:31:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm sorry that I was born weak!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.17,0:31:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me... Dad, help me!Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Dad!Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.30,0:32:05.63,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Sewil  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack, Sewil  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Attack Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:00.47,0:00:03.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,IDialogue: 1,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.01,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.49,0:00:03.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:00:00.49,0:00:03.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:00.51,0:00:03.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:00.51,0:00:03.08,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.52,0:00:03.09,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:00:00.52,0:00:03.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:00.53,0:00:03.11,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:00:00.53,0:00:03.12,L